{"version":1,"content":"<p>Spotify正在加強對Premium Family家庭訂閲套餐的審核，要求部分用户通過掃描動態二維碼，證明自己與套餐管理者居住在同一住所。未能在規定期限內完成驗證的用户，將失去加入其他家庭套餐或Duo雙人套餐的資格，限制期限長達12個月。這項措施意味着，過去不少用户通過與異地親友共同分攤訂閲費用的方式使用Spotify高級服務，今後可能面臨更嚴格的限制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/music/1583498.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.456242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:57:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.951755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.951755+00:00","content_hash":"fa3961155014fe50142da9b76a850b77d80e27d17208d3e20641109115abaef7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}